        }
       }
      ],
      "text": "Raised ICP mechanisms: mass effect (tumor, hematoma), cerebral edema, hemorrhage, CSF obstruction/hydrocephalus (Monro-Kellie doctrine: fixed skull). Cushing’s triad + papilledema + declining consciousness → herniation risk → emergent management"
     }
