        "type": "size",
        "attrs": {
         "pt": 8
        }
       }
      ],
      "text": "CHI focused exam components: mental status/GCS, pupils, cranial nerves, motor/sensory, coordination, skull inspection. Battle sign (mastoid bruising), raccoon eyes (periorbital ecchymosis), hemotympanum, CSF oto-/rhinorrhea → basilar skull fracture. CHI red flags: LOC worsening, amnesia (antegrade & retrograde), progressive sx → neuroimaging"
     }
